761
03:00:46,790 --> 03:01:08,410
Marizza B. Grande: Yes, sir. We rely on the submission of the local civil registry offices on the registration including the post and the sharia. But as the PSA is also in charge in the censuses, we get information also on the birth registration.

762
03:01:08,930 --> 03:01:23,200
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Yes. And tama din po with respect to the CRS database. Hindi po nagko-conduct yung PSA natin ng field investigation to investigate whether all deaths, I'm referring to deaths, Atty. Mae, in the country is registered.

